# TECH-G18: stackable with no arguments: stacked types saved in a .mag; pm12c lookup.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
snap internal
load a
box 0 0 4 4
paint pc
box 0 0 4 4
paint m2c
box 10 0 14 4
paint ndc
box 10 0 14 4
paint m2c
save a
tech layers pm12c
tech layers *
